
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Seller Application Update</title>
</head>

<body style="margin:0;padding:24px;background:#f4f5f7;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#111827;">
  <div style="max-width:600px;margin:auto;background:#ffffff;padding:32px;border-radius:12px;">

    <h1 style="margin-top:0;">Marto Marketplace</h1>

    <h2>Seller Application Update</h2>

    <p>Hello {{businessName}},</p>

    <p>
      Unfortunately, your seller application has not been approved
      by our administration team.
    </p>

    <div style="padding:16px;background:#fee2e2;border-radius:8px;">
      <strong style="font-size:20px;color:#991b1b;">REJECTED</strong>
    </div>

    <h3>Reason for rejection</h3>

    <p style="padding:16px;background:#f3f4f6;border-radius:8px;">
      {{reason}}
    </p>

    <p>
      Please review the reason above. If you believe this decision
      was made in error or have additional information, please
      contact Marto Marketplace support.
    </p>

    <p style="color:#6b7280;font-size:13px;">
      Application submitted: {{submittedAt}}
    </p>

    <p>Thank you for your understanding.</p>

    <p>Best regards,<br>Marto Marketplace Team</p>

  </div>
</body>
</html>
